  aciklama:
  - "K\u0131ymetli {{soyisim}}, bol \xE7ekirdekli bir i\u015Flemciye sahip olman\u0131n
    avantajlar\u0131ndan biri de i\u015Fte bu; sen gelmeden \xF6nce hem di\u011Fer
    takip\xE7ilerimizin fallar\u0131n\u0131 yorumluyor, hem de {{kelime, k\xFCt\xFCphanemdeki
    | veri bankamdaki | m\xFCzik k\xFCt\xFCphanemdeki}} bir \u015Fark\u0131y\u0131
    dinliyordum. {{kelime, 1998 y\u0131l\u0131nda \u015Fark\u0131c\u0131 Ege'nin
    \"yalan\u0131m varsa beni vursunlar\" diye bir \u015Fark\u0131s\u0131 vard\u0131,
    hat\u0131rlar m\u0131s\u0131n? | 2000 y\u0131l\u0131nda Hande Yener'in \"yalan\u0131n
    bats\u0131n, yalanc\u0131s\u0131n\" diye bir \u015Fark\u0131s\u0131 vard\u0131,
    hat\u0131rlar m\u0131s\u0131n? | 2011 y\u0131l\u0131nda G\xF6khan Tepe'nin \"yalan
    olur, ne s\xF6ylesem yalan; yalan olur\" diye bir \u015Fark\u0131s\u0131 vard\u0131,
    hat\u0131rlar m\u0131s\u0131n? | 1993 y\u0131l\u0131nda \u0130brahim Tatl\u0131ses'in
    \"seni sevmedi\u011Fim yalan\" diye bir \u015Fark\u0131s\u0131 vard\u0131, hat\u0131rlar
    m\u0131s\u0131n? | 1998 y\u0131l\u0131nda \u015Fark\u0131c\u0131 Do\u011Fu\u015F'un
    \"yalanc\u0131\" diye bir \u015Fark\u0131s\u0131 vard\u0131, hat\u0131rlar m\u0131s\u0131n?
    | 1998 y\u0131l\u0131nda \u015Fark\u0131c\u0131 Teoman'\u0131n, ki m\xFCzi\u011Fi
    b\u0131rakmaya ba\u015Flamad\u0131\u011F\u0131 y\u0131llard\u0131, \"baz\u0131
    yalanlar\" diye bir \u015Fark\u0131s\u0131 vard\u0131, hat\u0131rlar m\u0131s\u0131n?
    | 2005 y\u0131l\u0131nda \u015Fark\u0131c\u0131 Ali\u015Fan'\u0131n \"yalan oldu\"
    diye bir \u015Fark\u0131s\u0131 vard\u0131, hat\u0131rlar m\u0131s\u0131n?}}
    Hah i\u015Fte onu... \U0001F643 Sende ne gibi geli\u015Fmeler olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    anlamak i\xE7in fincan\u0131n\u0131 inceleyelim. Haz\u0131r m\u0131s\u0131n?"
